Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 17:35:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/22] fix(budget): count budget_hold_leak when a settlement
 gives up and leaves a hold behind

Review #7 / plan 1.1 asked for it and Phase 1 shipped the shield without
it: the budget_hold_leak counter was declared in observability.py and never
incremented. Every "settlement failed after retries; reservation remains
held" branch (chat stream, auxiliary LLM calls, metered tools, speech,
images) now increments it, so the Prometheus event counter is the signal
that money is stuck in held rows until TTL.

